<title>SPAIN: Spain revises harvest forecasts.</title>
<headline>Spain revises harvest forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Agriculture Ministry on Thursday provided the following provisional June forecasts for 1997 harvests (figures in millions of tonnes).</p>
<p>			JUNE	MAY	  '96 TOTAL (EST)</p>
<p> Hard wheat	 1.11	1.16	 1.71</p>
<p> Soft wheat	 3.36	3.39	 4.46</p>
<p> Barley	     8.40	8.22	10.64</p>
<p> Maize		4.33	4.15	 3.70</p>
<p>Sugar beet:</p>
<p>    Summer	  1.86	2.02	 2.13</p>
<p>    Winter	  6.11	 -	   6.31</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures show official forecasts in current month versus forecasts made the previous month. Last year's harvest totals are estimated.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
